+
+Changed behaviors
+-----------------
+-   ``LangevinDynamicsMove`` now uses ``openmm.LangevinMiddleIntegrator`` (a BAOAB integrator) instead of `openmm.LangevinIntegrator`` (an OBABO integrator).
